folio (0.1.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New: VitruvianOS .deb for arm64 as well as amd64, both built in CI on
    Debian trixie.
  * The Linux AppImage is built with Hokku (a Cosmoe fork with fixes for
    pointer events, tooltips and font styles) and is smoke-tested on
    Wayland as well as X11.
  * Packaging moved to the shared haiku-* release templates; package
    metadata lives in haiku-app.env.

 -- idumych <19998719+idumych@users.noreply.github.com>  Fri, 23 Oct 2026 19:34:15 -0700

folio (0.1.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

