folio (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First package, for VitruvianOS 0.6.x (amd64).
  * Notebooks, sections and pages as Markdown files, with [[wiki links]]
    that are rewritten when a page, section or notebook is renamed or moved,
    including renames made in Tracker or a terminal.
  * Backlinks, #tags, to-dos, full-text search and attachments.

